IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa-core`
IMPORT `coa23-nouns`
IMPORT `coa23-part35-registrar`

-- coa23-tests-part35-registrar.l4: tests for coa23-part35-registrar.l4 (ss 1059A to 1071). Every expected value is
-- written here from the text of the section named beside it, before the module was run; none is copied from its output.
-- A failing assertion would be a finding, not an edit to the expected value. A #TRACE cannot be asserted on this binary, so
-- each is preceded by an -- EXPECT: line that work/check-traces.py compares with the binary's output.


