#ASSERT `s 1066(3) the registrar may change the existing registered number` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 1066(3) the registrar may change the existing registered number` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 1066(3) the registrar may change the existing registered number` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- s 1066(4): a change has effect from the date the company is notified. Notified on 1 March 2020: the day before is outside, the day itself and the day after are inside
