    PARTY Registrar DOES `Action of a party` OF Registrar, Company, "publish notice of the issue of the certificate of incorporation" AT 2
-- EXPECT: RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 1064(1) the registrar's duty to publish notice of the issue of a certificate of incorporation` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 30)
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 1065 the right of any person to a copy of a certificate of incorporation` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `s 1065 any person` DOES `s 1065 require a copy of a certificate of incorporation` AT 5
-- EXPECT: BREACH
#TRACE `s 1067A(1) the prohibition on an individual delivering a document on their own behalf` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `s 1067A an individual who delivers a document to the registrar` DOES `s 1067A deliver a document on their own behalf` FALSE TRUE AT 1
-- EXPECT: BREACH
#TRACE `s 1067A(1) the prohibition on an individual delivering a document on their own behalf` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `s 1067A an individual who delivers a document to the registrar` DOES `s 1067A deliver a document on their own behalf` TRUE FALSE AT 1
-- EXPECT: RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 1067A(1) the prohibition on an individual delivering a document on their own behalf` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `s 1067A an individual who delivers a document to the registrar` DOES `s 1067A deliver a document on their own behalf` TRUE TRUE AT 1
-- EXPECT: BREACH
#TRACE `s 1067B(1) the prohibition on a disqualified individual delivering documents` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `s 1067A an individual who delivers a document to the registrar` DOES `s 1067B deliver documents on their own behalf or on behalf of another as a disqualified person` AT 1
-- EXPECT: RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 1067B(1) the prohibition on a disqualified individual delivering documents` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 30)
